nd poor criticism. Candidate C strong on reliability and crew atmosphere, but communication and egocentric.\n\nMaybe we need to ask other panel members for missing criteria: e.g., decision quality for Candidate B, stress resilience for Candidate C, etc. But we can still give provisional recommendation.\n\nWe could start by highlighting Candidate B's strengths and concerns, and propose provisional recommendation for Candidate B, but note concerns about cooperation.\n\nAlternatively, we could propose Candidate C as leading due to reliability and positive crew atmosphere, but note communication issues.\n\nGiven we need to cover all candidates eventually, maybe start with Candidate B as provisional recommendation, and ask others for more info on cooperation.\n\nLet's produce a public message: state current recommendation: Candidate B. Reference that no prior discussion, but we are starting. Provide evidence: conscientious, handles stress well, good at weather, computer skills. Concern: grumpy, uncooperative. Implication: strong reliability and stress but crew cooperation concerns may be mitigated? We need to compare with others.\n\nWe'll also note that we need more info on Candidate B's decision quality and crew cooperation.\n\nOk."}
